{"4142540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "gAillery: Don't Trust Your Eyes", "steam_appid": 4142540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You’re trapped in a gallery with a robot <strong>museum guard</strong>. In front of you are masterpieces of art — but among them there may be a work created by AI.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you recognize an AI-made piece, go down the left corridor.<br>If you believe all the paintings were created by world-famous artists, go to the right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why add it to your wishlist?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exciting gallery of world masterpieces in a game format that’s impossible to put down. It lets you experience hundreds of world-famous masterpieces at an affordable price. Key values:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Educational</strong> — every painting has its own story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique genre</strong> — at the intersection of art and game development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-tier visuals</strong> — screenshots of our game are often mistaken for real photos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI paintings don’t try to imitate: each work is self-contained and comes into this world with its own fictional backstory. Don’t look for a trick — look for the intention.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hundreds of masterpieces. A time loop. Will you find the way out?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist to be the first to know when it launches.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You’re trapped in a gallery with a robot <strong>museum guard</strong>. In front of you are masterpieces of art — but among them there may be a work created by AI.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you recognize an AI-made piece, go down the left corridor.<br>If you bel